1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,317
Two dense tissues, always compared.

2
00:00:02,317 --> 00:00:06,510
A tendon is packed with parallel bundles of white collagen.

3
00:00:06,510 --> 00:00:09,205
Pull it, and it barely stretches.

4
00:00:09,205 --> 00:00:13,033
A ligament has branching yellow elastic fibres.

5
00:00:13,033 --> 00:00:16,223
Pull it, and it stretches, then springs back.

